t=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu3etkjSMUCdVcxKMiYcYOXyzYfN1R2YYX3gJ8g8IOKfQ&oe=69A449B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o6gG11kmJ3IQ7kNvwHm2lF0&_nc_oc=Adne3epXyoFKuCPbWa-PmrFHvCUNNVS-eNbzHLfL2M4XYjQoPmKGCpGQFzysAUmzb_E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuG52a7Dq92lXRYricBHM55COrn2WOppg2ki4Gmc359CQ&oe=69A44B4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zBWoqJC-B24Q7kNvwGm7Elo&_nc_oc=AdlS8fItUrSIhhrFBjZbayp97zpRNK28vrLle7L74jBWTnwCu9eHzRwArmAIRHJkDXo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvE0lSTb3V-Sn-gDvm34tL4yJ9pJar1n7cikz1Wn4SFsQ&oe=69A4386F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DadJRr-LGQ8Q7kNvwF3Ij1f&_nc_oc=Adldbb9_vUHDY1nM4o32WY6eHDHAsN0miHtSWWimxKiRcdyVsSiSFm-xs9QGd1w_iT8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuvO45EhkvfAuL4frbsLqI2KBKev13qvcvJpFdsMHWznA&oe=69A421C3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EIC7oEU61R4Q7kNvwEpzKZT&_nc_oc=AdnYllwWlMyklqBr1OadY0WcYHexXtXn9xi4JHPIWDLhax-sxTs5ZgBx9Q_NH1rCHjs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftdWLRvzBZdzEBRKx5bcCFduPGHIqZvtT1YQgNgH4Q8rQ&oe=69A41A18"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C1XDSFljPmkQ7kNvwGD3Xyq&_nc_oc=Adni38OZIbagqf-1m2GxUhm3lzO4LajpUAP_kxKmykdtxyP_gwmaEjali5_uKJc9axg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvfQWB9wZJfB4nn33UxJAgYxAwVHcx5yJIJOOnKaUogbQ&oe=69A42D3C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_6208099537495751086_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RsK2tyiFMhgQ7kNvwEylVP5&_nc_oc=Adm2mULXjhitcIviuNOT-5MSbf3Zg6lvlEkreAxgRgLfy-FmDQow6QELzTvIDqN1GlE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=sco